"Bet's fever is marsh fever and will break on the fifth or sixth day; Hild knows it in her bones."
"Hild keeps one crystal vial of blue healing potion, bought in Bramwick years ago, for a case she cannot save."
"Hild would not spend the potion on a fever; she is saving it for a bleeding or a birth."
"Ashford has no midwife but Hild, and she has never lost a mother."
"Hild noticed Nala's shirt is finer than her dress, and has said nothing of it yet."
"The man Bet saw in the trees at the meadow was one of the deserters, snaring at first light."
"Bet caught her fever lying out at the meadow ditch two dawns after she saw him, hiding from him."
